{"id":"RC-009","claim":"Grand Launcher (CUPLESOFT) home screen exposes 6 large functions; tapping status icons (battery, signal, date) shows an explanatory message; lists in calls/contacts show ONE item per screen with a Next button.","q":["Q1"],"evidence_type":"direct","source_url":"https://orientatech.es/app-grand-launcher/","source_class":"L3","verbatim_quote":"La pantalla principal permite acceder a 6 funcionalidades diferentes... las listas presentan un elemento cada vez y tienen el botón 'próximo' para ver el siguiente elemento","hedged":False,"notes":"One-item-per-screen paging is an extreme low-cognitive-load pattern."},
